            <div xml:id="d764">

                <pb facs="0895" n="799" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg799"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">361.11/3763: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-07-16T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1921—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:15 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>34. Nansen has received telegram from Tchitcherin dated 10th reading as follows:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“We regret that our answer to your telegram of May 26th was not received
                            by you but we cannot add anything regarding interned Americans to our
                            communication previous to that date.” Tchitcherin.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
